Streaming Markdown parser

Upstream: https://github.com/thetarnav/streaming-markdown
Source revision: 6beb92d991ed5a16f62cdfefac739b6eee45555f
License: MIT (see streaming-markdown.LICENSE)

The upstream ES module exports were wrapped in a guarded global namespace so
the parser can be injected as a classic Manifest V3 script. The extension uses
a custom DOM renderer to validate links and avoid loading remote images.
